!!! oculus/compositor/frame.mat
!!! A composed snapshot of the scene.
!!!
!!! A frame is the result of one composition pass — the
!!! scene as rendered to a specific surface, with damage
!!! tracking and output routing.

book oculus.compositor.frame

read everything from oculus.compositor.surface
read everything from oculus.compositor.damage
read everything from oculus.compositor.output
read everything from oculus.scene.manager
read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! A composed frame.

public frame begin record
    field revision as override long
    field surface as surface
    field damage as damage-tracker
    field output-id as override long
    field is-dirty as boolean
end record
